{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-23T16:54:32.024Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `src/core/foundation/config-gates.ts`: added optional `gates.autoRetries` (default 1) with validation rejecting negative/fractional/non-numeric values.\n- `src/watcher/auto-retry.ts` (new, 231 lines): exported `ELIGIBLE_AUTO_RETRY_REASONS` and `runAutomaticRetries`. It decides per active dead task, detects stuck (active fingerprint equals highest-ordinal retained `dead/<n>.<k>.md`), counts automatic retries after the later of `approvedAt` and the last manual retry, and calls `retrySpec(..., { automatic: true })`.\n- `src/watcher/loop.ts`: calls the decision for every approved change after reaping and before task picking, re-derives state after a retry, tracks a `retried` progress count so `runWatcherOnce` runs the retried task, and passes `projectRoot` to the reaper's `writeDeadMarker`.\n- `src/harness/types.ts`: typed `retry.automatic` and the new `stuck` event.\n\n**Tests**\n- New `tests/auto-retry.test.ts` (6 integration scenarios) and `tests/auto-retry-config.test.ts`.\n- `tests/retry-watch.test.ts`: only its written `osq.config.ts` gained `autoRetries: 0`.\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify: `node --import tsx --test tests/auto-retry.test.ts tests/auto-retry-config.test.ts` → 12/12 pass.\n- Proposal verify: `pnpm verify` → typechecks, build, 1503 CLI + 88 UI tests, and lint all pass.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/065-automatic-retry/.run/results/4.md`."}}
